<title>UK: OPEC Jan output 25.38 million bpd, members say.</title>
<headline>OPEC Jan output 25.38 million bpd, members say.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>OPEC pumped 25.38 million barrels a day (bpd) in January, up from 24.98 million in December, a monthly report from OPEC's Vienna-based secretariat said.</p>
<p>By comparison, a Reuters survey put OPEC output at 26.64 million barrels a day (bpd). The 11-member group has an official ceiling of 25.033 million bpd.</p>
<p>The secretariat report projected world demand for crude this year at 70.92 million barrels a day (bpd), up 80,000 bpd from the previous report.</p>
<p>It put the likely call on OPEC crude this year at 25.2 million bpd.</p>
<p>--London newsroom +44 171 542 8060</p>
</text>
